  "summary": "I joined Bend Financial as an early engineer post-Series A and stayed through the 2022 acquisition by HSA Bank.\nMost of the last six years has been building financial infrastructure through a startup-to-enterprise transition: regulated environment, multiple simultaneous vendor integrations, and a user base that grew 100x post-acquisition (35K → 3.5M+ accounts).\n\nBefore that: simulation software for petrochemical clients at Aspen Technology, then internal tooling for airline inventory management at EF Education First.\n\nWork I'm proud of:\n- Owned file integration for a debit card migration with 10-figure contract penalty exposure — including a custom COBOL picture parser to reverse-engineer vendor file formats when documentation didn't exist\n- Optimized AWS Lambda-based data ingest pipelines to handle the scale jump through file partitioning and parallel execution\n- Acted as interim team lead across 19 weeks during critical delivery phases, managing stakeholder comms and technical prioritization under daily C-suite oversight\n\nAWS Certified Solutions Architect (Feb. 2025). Full-stack across .NET/C#, TypeScript/React, and Python. I care a lot about system design, testability, and operational reliability.\n\nOpen to senior IC or lead roles at seed–Series B companies, particularly in fintech, hard-tech, or life sciences.",
