    "description": "Joined post-Series A; stayed through acquisition by Webster Bank in 2022. Same codebase, meaningfully different scale.\n\nDEBIT CARD MIGRATION\nOwned file integration as technical SME on a project with 10-figure contract penalty exposure. Built a custom COBOL parser to reverse-engineer vendor file formats where documentation was absent. Served as interim team lead (19 weeks across 2023–2025) during critical delivery phases including peak season and post-migration support, under daily C-suite visibility.\n\nSCALE\nOptimized AWS Lambda-based data ingest pipelines (file partitioning, parallel execution, performance tuning) through 100x account growth (35K → 3.5M+). Collaborated on SNS → Kafka migration for async processing at scale.\n\nTOOLING\nBuilt automated test data generation tool (C#/PowerShell) independently to address team testing bottlenecks. Adopted team-wide; became foundation for integration testing.\n\nEARLIER\nAccount verification automation, multi-custodian integrations, customer-facing features in Vue.js, microservices and serverless infrastructure on AWS.",
